  message: "Re-titled: the original said \"10 of 11 auto-pr test files\", which was the measurement I filed it on and which the real measurement superseded (46 of 73 root tests, across bakeoff / ci-debug / merge-pr / prepare-release / session hooks -- auto-pr was one instance, not the scope). Leaving a known-understated title on a closed item is the deferral the decision register calibration note warns about, so fixing it now rather than at a hygiene sweep."  # bbd3
